(398444, 34659, 7857, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats an amazing structure, be interested to know where and why. The IR is a nice option for this, I get the feeling that you''d miss the same impact if it were in colour. Nice focus, good choice - Good luck!</td>', 'Wow, thats an amazing structure, be interested to know where and why. The IR is a nice option for this, I get the feeling that you''d miss the same impact if it were in colour. Nice focus, good choice - Good luck!', '2003-08-25 06:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(398450, 34666, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible composition. Absolutely beautiful. Love the way you were able to capture all the chisel strokes on the head. Wow.</td>', 'Incredible composition. Absolutely beautiful. Love the way you were able to capture all the chisel strokes on the head. Wow.', '2003-08-25 07:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(398451, 34176, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the way you were able to capture the surface texture of the head. Bring us close to see the crack in the face. Gives it great character. Awesome job.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the way you were able to capture the surface texture of the head. Bring us close to see the crack in the face. Gives it great character. Awesome job.', '2003-08-25 07:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(398452, 34899, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Love the color. The shadows of the figure you were able to capture is incredible. Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Love the color. The shadows of the figure you were able to capture is incredible. Great job.', '2003-08-25 07:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(398453, 34659, 10084, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like IR pictures but this one really works. Love the shadows that you captures in the blocks. Great composition. Beautiful.</td>', 'I normally don''t like IR pictures but this one really works. Love the shadows that you captures in the blocks. Great composition. Beautiful.', '2003-08-25 07:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(398454, 34559, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The way you have the colors makes it look very cartoonish. Love it. Colors are very vivid and makes the totem stand out a lot. Beautiful.</td>', 'Great composition. The way you have the colors makes it look very cartoonish. Love it. Colors are very vivid and makes the totem stand out a lot. Beautiful.', '2003-08-25 07:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(398456, 34817, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is fine. Would look better if you were able to blurred out the tree a bit. It may look like angel wings coming out of the statue but because the leaves have a lot of edges it distracts from the statue. Blurring should still give the same effect while still bring the statue more to the viewers attention.</td>', 'Composition is fine. Would look better if you were able to blurred out the tree a bit. It may look like angel wings coming out of the statue but because the leaves have a lot of edges it distracts from the statue. Blurring should still give the same effect while still bring the statue more to the viewers attention.', '2003-08-25 07:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(398458, 34877, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. I like the way you crop this one. Sometimes cropping out the whole statue takes away from the image, but I think this one works. The facial expression is captured and it shows him facing where he is going to pitch to. Great depth of field. Really bring the statue alive.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. I like the way you crop this one. Sometimes cropping out the whole statue takes away from the image, but I think this one works. The facial expression is captured and it shows him facing where he is going to pitch to. Great depth of field. Really bring the statue alive.', '2003-08-25 07:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(398460, 34491, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Good angle selected for impact. Focus is excellent.</td>', 'Great composition. Good angle selected for impact. Focus is excellent.', '2003-08-25 07:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
