(399146, 34832, 3554, '<td valign="top">Generally I like this shot, the color is interesting. I like that the top is cut off the basketball in order to show more of the arm below, though I''d guess some would disagree. The only thing I don''t like is that this shot feels exceptionally flat for a monument.</td>', 'Generally I like this shot, the color is interesting. I like that the top is cut off the basketball in order to show more of the arm below, though I''d guess some would disagree. The only thing I don''t like is that this shot feels exceptionally flat for a monument.', '2003-08-25 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
