(399467, 34869, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and focused. The light blue sky in the background contrasts very positively with the color of the statue, and makes the yellow tones stand out more prominently.</td>', 'Very sharp and focused. The light blue sky in the background contrasts very positively with the color of the statue, and makes the yellow tones stand out more prominently.', '2003-08-26 04:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(399470, 34864, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very classy photo. I especially like the way the reds of the leaves stand out by choosing such a shallow DOF. The border is very fitting and the composition is spot on in my opinion. The only thing stopping me giving this pic a 10 is that the main subject is the tree and not the monuments in the background. Still worth a 9 though.</td>', 'This is a very classy photo. I especially like the way the reds of the leaves stand out by choosing such a shallow DOF. The border is very fitting and the composition is spot on in my opinion. The only thing stopping me giving this pic a 10 is that the main subject is the tree and not the monuments in the background. Still worth a 9 though.', '2003-08-26 04:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(399473, 34676, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now I know you didn''t go all the way to Egypt to take this photo :-)  The left ear seems to be lower than the right ear, is that just me or is it really like that? I like the courseness of the stone which you''ve brought out very well - 8.</td>', 'Now I know you didn''t go all the way to Egypt to take this photo :-)  The left ear seems to be lower than the right ear, is that just me or is it really like that? I like the courseness of the stone which you''ve brought out very well - 8.', '2003-08-26 04:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(399483, 34221, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring, composition and DOF.  This shot was really enhanced by the angle you took it from.  One of my favorites.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice coloring, composition and DOF.  This shot was really enhanced by the angle you took it from.  One of my favorites.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(399484, 34875, 2567, '<td valign="top">Love the coloring.  Good composition and DOF.  Nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love the coloring.  Good composition and DOF.  Nice shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(399494, 34666, 5728, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the play of light and shadow in this photo. It''s one of those images where you can''t decide if it is too dark or not, so I guess if I have to ask myself that, then it must be spot on. The contrasting is pleasing to my eyes, especially the darker shadows in the chiselled out areas compared to the lighter flatter areas. The pure black background brings our the contours of the face more prominently. This is very good work.</td>', 'I particularly like the play of light and shadow in this photo. It''s one of those images where you can''t decide if it is too dark or not, so I guess if I have to ask myself that, then it must be spot on. The contrasting is pleasing to my eyes, especially the darker shadows in the chiselled out areas compared to the lighter flatter areas. The pure black background brings our the contours of the face more prominently. This is very good work.', '2003-08-26 05:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(399501, 34414, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition which seems to work well. The tight crop and the shallow DOF blurring out the background do this image justice!</td>', 'This is an interesting composition which seems to work well. The tight crop and the shallow DOF blurring out the background do this image justice!', '2003-08-26 05:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(399506, 34875, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful monument which you''ve portrayed excellently. I guess this is the late evening sunlight you''ve captured there? Your monument is bathed in such a soft soothing light, it gives off a serene feeling, especially with the added bonus of no people being in the image. The decision to leave the trees in the pic only does this justice. This is good work!</td>', 'That''s a beautiful monument which you''ve portrayed excellently. I guess this is the late evening sunlight you''ve captured there? Your monument is bathed in such a soft soothing light, it gives off a serene feeling, especially with the added bonus of no people being in the image. The decision to leave the trees in the pic only does this justice. This is good work!', '2003-08-26 05:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(399509, 34443, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny statue :-) The background is a little too busy though. Maybe you should have tried to shoot this from a different angle. A good idea might have been to get down a little and shoot upwards so that you get more sky in the background and less building and power lines.</td>', 'Funny statue :-) The background is a little too busy though. Maybe you should have tried to shoot this from a different angle. A good idea might have been to get down a little and shoot upwards so that you get more sky in the background and less building and power lines.', '2003-08-26 05:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(399511, 34679, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wizard of Oz right? The main focus is on the head and the shoes and hand are not fully in focus. Also the shoes seem to be a little distracting in the postion you have them. A slightly different shooting angle and different f/stop would have improved this somewhat.</td>', 'Wizard of Oz right? The main focus is on the head and the shoes and hand are not fully in focus. Also the shoes seem to be a little distracting in the postion you have them. A slightly different shooting angle and different f/stop would have improved this somewhat.', '2003-08-26 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399515, 34563, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good perspective on the picture, very nicely done! - 8</td>', 'Good perspective on the picture, very nicely done! - 8', '2003-08-26 05:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(399525, 34891, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a nice statue, is that grass all around it? The rest of the photo seems a little too busy with all the buildings and tourists everywhere. I guess you couldn''t have told everyone to go away, but maybe a different shooting angle could have made a difference. Perhaps going in lower and shooting upwards to get more sky into the shot and less people could have been a good idea.</td>', 'This is a nice statue, is that grass all around it? The rest of the photo seems a little too busy with all the buildings and tourists everywhere. I guess you couldn''t have told everyone to go away, but maybe a different shooting angle could have made a difference. Perhaps going in lower and shooting upwards to get more sky into the shot and less people could have been a good idea.', '2003-08-26 06:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(399540, 34559, 10883, '<td valign="top">The red color is overdone IMHO, it looks to ,,processed"</td>', 'The red color is overdone IMHO, it looks to ,,processed"', '2003-08-26 06:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(399544, 34877, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good DOF!</td>', 'Nice perspective and good DOF!', '2003-08-26 06:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(399547, 34875, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice use of daylight, it fits the building very well in this picture!</td>', 'Nice use of daylight, it fits the building very well in this picture!', '2003-08-26 06:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(399549, 34896, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture!  Good use of shadows and light! - 8</td>', 'Excellent picture!  Good use of shadows and light! - 8', '2003-08-26 06:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(399568, 34891, 7857, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great. Nice angle to shoot from, good colour. Its a shame it was such a busy time, i think the people in the lower right get in the way a bit. Good job.</td>', 'Wow, this is great. Nice angle to shoot from, good colour. Its a shame it was such a busy time, i think the people in the lower right get in the way a bit. Good job.', '2003-08-26 06:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(399572, 34221, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo, the contrast between the blue sky, black tree silohuettes, statue color and yellow light is an optimal mix. Just fantastic! This is one of my top picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo, the contrast between the blue sky, black tree silohuettes, statue color and yellow light is an optimal mix. Just fantastic! This is one of my top picks for a ribbon.', '2003-08-26 06:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(399576, 34318, 5728, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you got that effect with one pillar tilting inwards and the one on the right being straight but it works! And how! The texture of the clouds in the background gives this that extra boost. The framing is spot on n''all. If this doesn''t ribbon I''m selling my camera and taking up chess :-)</td>', 'I don''t know how you got that effect with one pillar tilting inwards and the one on the right being straight but it works! And how! The texture of the clouds in the background gives this that extra boost. The framing is spot on n''all. If this doesn''t ribbon I''m selling my camera and taking up chess :-)', '2003-08-26 07:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(399577, 34491, 10848, '<td valign="top">Love this photo...you captured the weathered look very well...the expression of hope on the face..I love the subject you chose and how you presented it great job!</td>', 'Love this photo...you captured the weathered look very well...the expression of hope on the face..I love the subject you chose and how you presented it great job!', '2003-08-26 07:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(399578, 34553, 10848, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh...I am gasping...this grabbed me!! Wonderful execution of style and the emotion that this photo brings to the viewer is astonishing..thats what photography is all about...making the viewer feel the photo not just view it...great job....I think this is a winner...its got my vote anyway!!</td>', 'Oh my gosh...I am gasping...this grabbed me!! Wonderful execution of style and the emotion that this photo brings to the viewer is astonishing..thats what photography is all about...making the viewer feel the photo not just view it...great job....I think this is a winner...its got my vote anyway!!', '2003-08-26 07:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(399579, 34901, 10848, '<td valign="top">This favors a monument/statue we have here in Alabama..is this the Vulcan? Great shot...good clarity and focus good job!</td>', 'This favors a monument/statue we have here in Alabama..is this the Vulcan? Great shot...good clarity and focus good job!', '2003-08-26 07:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(399580, 34556, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot...I like the way you captured a profile shot and not just face on.Not centered  adds drama to the shot...good job!</td>', 'Great shot...I like the way you captured a profile shot and not just face on.Not centered  adds drama to the shot...good job!', '2003-08-26 07:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(399582, 34817, 10848, '<td valign="top">I love this statue/monument...being a mother myself I can relate..I love the way you captured the white marble against the dark greenery of the background..give the statue/monument more effect. Good job! By the way where is this...gorgeous!</td>', 'I love this statue/monument...being a mother myself I can relate..I love the way you captured the white marble against the dark greenery of the background..give the statue/monument more effect. Good job! By the way where is this...gorgeous!', '2003-08-26 07:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(399583, 34646, 5728, '<td valign="top">That guy looks like he''s in a hurry :-) I like how you put the tilt into the image, it does a lot for it. Good lighting (although it was taken at midday :-) and the idea to convert to grayscale was the best choice in my opinion.</td>', 'That guy looks like he''s in a hurry :-) I like how you put the tilt into the image, it does a lot for it. Good lighting (although it was taken at midday :-) and the idea to convert to grayscale was the best choice in my opinion.', '2003-08-26 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399610, 34865, 3320, '<td valign="top">Might be the only statue I like this week, nice texture , exposition and background.</td>', 'Might be the only statue I like this week, nice texture , exposition and background.', '2003-08-26 08:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(399612, 34789, 3084, '<td valign="top">I thought that it was 2001?</td>', 'I thought that it was 2001?', '2003-08-26 08:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(399621, 34896, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is a good capture. Kewl the way you got the guy on the horse staring at the sunset in the distance. The silohuette effect just does it here for me.</td>', 'Now this is a good capture. Kewl the way you got the guy on the horse staring at the sunset in the distance. The silohuette effect just does it here for me.', '2003-08-26 09:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(399623, 34832, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice composition, especially the way you didn''t include the whole ball in the image. It kinds of leaves it up to your imagination if there is a basket there or not. Also cropping out the bottom and top part extends the photo longer than it actually is.</td>', 'Choice composition, especially the way you didn''t include the whole ball in the image. It kinds of leaves it up to your imagination if there is a basket there or not. Also cropping out the bottom and top part extends the photo longer than it actually is.', '2003-08-26 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(399641, 34539, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination with the red graphics on the stone. Good find.</td>', 'Nice color combination with the red graphics on the stone. Good find.', '2003-08-26 10:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(399642, 34137, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, especially with the two people with the same hats on :-)</td>', 'Good capture, especially with the two people with the same hats on :-)', '2003-08-26 10:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(399644, 34893, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, although I would have prefered some "breathing" space in the direction he is looking. Otherwise good, very focused.</td>', 'Nice angle, although I would have prefered some "breathing" space in the direction he is looking. Otherwise good, very focused.', '2003-08-26 10:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(399645, 34883, 2170, '<td valign="top">phallic!</td>', 'phallic!', '2003-08-26 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(399647, 34915, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry shot. Looks good in B&amp;W, the crop is very fitting.</td>', 'Nice symmetry shot. Looks good in B&W, the crop is very fitting.', '2003-08-26 10:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(399648, 34563, 2170, '<td valign="top">nicely composed.  good dof.</td>', 'nicely composed.  good dof.', '2003-08-26 10:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(399649, 34532, 2170, '<td valign="top">i love how this looks like it''s come off of a 100-year-old postcard.</td>', 'i love how this looks like it''s come off of a 100-year-old postcard.', '2003-08-26 10:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399651, 34807, 2170, '<td valign="top">beautiful color</td>', 'beautiful color', '2003-08-26 10:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(399652, 34557, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is an interesting monument. Gold always makes for a good statue. The title is way too long though.</td>', 'Now this is an interesting monument. Gold always makes for a good statue. The title is way too long though.', '2003-08-26 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(399653, 34502, 2170, '<td valign="top">I feel like this could have been shot from a much more interesting angle, eliminating the cluttered background and the child in the front.  I think the presence of cars and people distract from the point of this challenge.</td>', 'I feel like this could have been shot from a much more interesting angle, eliminating the cluttered background and the child in the front.  I think the presence of cars and people distract from the point of this challenge.', '2003-08-26 10:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(399654, 34221, 2170, '<td valign="top">great angle and great color</td>', 'great angle and great color', '2003-08-26 10:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399656, 34176, 2170, '<td valign="top">excellently cropped.  you''ve got a great eye for details like this, and the title (although I''m not a title person, really) is dead-on perfect.</td>', 'excellently cropped.  you''ve got a great eye for details like this, and the title (although I''m not a title person, really) is dead-on perfect.', '2003-08-26 10:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(399658, 34898, 2170, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop on this would have made it much more powerful.  As it is now, I can''t make out any of the detail on the arm...it looks like people, but I''m not sure.  They also get lost in the trees.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop on this would have made it much more powerful.  As it is now, I can''t make out any of the detail on the arm...it looks like people, but I''m not sure.  They also get lost in the trees.', '2003-08-26 10:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(399659, 34678, 2170, '<td valign="top">the coloring in this is really washed out...</td>', 'the coloring in this is really washed out...', '2003-08-26 10:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399660, 34819, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny statue :-) The background is a little busy however and takes my attention away from your main subject somewhat. Maybe a different shooting angle or shallower DOF to blur out the background would have taken care of that.</td>', 'Funny statue :-) The background is a little busy however and takes my attention away from your main subject somewhat. Maybe a different shooting angle or shallower DOF to blur out the background would have taken care of that.', '2003-08-26 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(399662, 34532, 5728, '<td valign="top">This has an old fashioned feel to it. Interesting sepia toning you chose.</td>', 'This has an old fashioned feel to it. Interesting sepia toning you chose.', '2003-08-26 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(399665, 34675, 5728, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered it if you had moved more to the left so as to get the tree out of the way, it is a little distracting. Or else use a wide open aperture to blur it out a little.</td>', 'I would have prefered it if you had moved more to the left so as to get the tree out of the way, it is a little distracting. Or else use a wide open aperture to blur it out a little.', '2003-08-26 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399670, 34768, 5728, '<td valign="top">Everything is full in focus here. I see what you have done here, you wanted to get the statue and the flags into the shot. <br/> <br/>For me there is a little too much in the photo with the building, statue, flags and plants. It appears a little on the busy side, too much to look at, you know what I mean? The statue itself looks very interesting but I can''t see enough of it. I would have gotten right into it and taken just the two figures close up.</td>', 'Everything is full in focus here. I see what you have done here, you wanted to get the statue and the flags into the shot.  For me there is a little too much in the photo with the building, statue, flags and plants. It appears a little on the busy side, too much to look at, you know what I mean? The statue itself looks very interesting but I can''t see enough of it. I would have gotten right into it and taken just the two figures close up.', '2003-08-26 10:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(399672, 34368, 5728, '<td valign="top">You get my vote for humor :-) Good idea, certainly different and well composed.</td>', 'You get my vote for humor :-) Good idea, certainly different and well composed.', '2003-08-26 10:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(399674, 34587, 5728, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse is tilting to the left a little, or is it like that in real life? Like the leaning tower of Pisa :-)</td>', 'The lighthouse is tilting to the left a little, or is it like that in real life? Like the leaning tower of Pisa :-)', '2003-08-26 10:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(399675, 34900, 8522, '<td valign="top">My favourite shot this challenge, and only 10. I''ve not come across this memorial, I wonder where it is? Beautiful sky and sun glare, this picture really seems to capture something that I think Hendrix would have ''dug''. Great composition and choice of wide angle. Great lighting. Thanks!</td>', 'My favourite shot this challenge, and only 10. I''ve not come across this memorial, I wonder where it is? Beautiful sky and sun glare, this picture really seems to capture something that I think Hendrix would have ''dug''. Great composition and choice of wide angle. Great lighting. Thanks!', '2003-08-26 10:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(399677, 34778, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, full of atmosphere. I love the leaves at the top. Great composition. The burnt out sky is a very effective compositional element. Very nice use of contrast. 9</td>', 'Wonderful shot, full of atmosphere. I love the leaves at the top. Great composition. The burnt out sky is a very effective compositional element. Very nice use of contrast. 9', '2003-08-26 10:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(399678, 34659, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot, great textures and use of IR. Not quite sure about the composition though, the elements in the frame don''t seem to balance proportionally to me. 8</td>', 'Intriguing shot, great textures and use of IR. Not quite sure about the composition though, the elements in the frame don''t seem to balance proportionally to me. 8', '2003-08-26 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(399679, 34874, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting statue. I would have moved a little to the left to take this photo (if possible) because that beam on the left kind of distracts. Also you would have hidden that guy sitting on the bench out there in the background. Maybe a wide open aperture might have blurred the background out a little as well. But otherwise it is good. What does he represent?</td>', 'That''s an interesting statue. I would have moved a little to the left to take this photo (if possible) because that beam on the left kind of distracts. Also you would have hidden that guy sitting on the bench out there in the background. Maybe a wide open aperture might have blurred the background out a little as well. But otherwise it is good. What does he represent?', '2003-08-26 10:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(399680, 34806, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like it, the lighting is amazing. The texture of the clouds in the sky also add a lot to this photo as they are the same color as the church.</td>', 'I like it, the lighting is amazing. The texture of the clouds in the sky also add a lot to this photo as they are the same color as the church.', '2003-08-26 10:35:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(399681, 34137, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the people on the left break up the centred symmetry of the building. Nice range of tones. Interesting assortment of shapes in this composition. Black and white works well here. 8</td>', 'Great shot, the people on the left break up the centred symmetry of the building. Nice range of tones. Interesting assortment of shapes in this composition. Black and white works well here. 8', '2003-08-26 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(399683, 34666, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very simple and effective. Nicely cropped and framed. Bit too much shadow in the eye socket for my taste, but only a minor flaw. You captured the textures and emotiveness well here. 8</td>', 'Very simple and effective. Nicely cropped and framed. Bit too much shadow in the eye socket for my taste, but only a minor flaw. You captured the textures and emotiveness well here. 8', '2003-08-26 10:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(399685, 34867, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice architecture shot, love the curves in it. A little too much glare from the sun on the middle part, but otherwise a very good photo.</td>', 'Nice architecture shot, love the curves in it. A little too much glare from the sun on the middle part, but otherwise a very good photo.', '2003-08-26 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(399686, 34886, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this picture leaves me very little to coneect with... who was George Rowland? What Indian wars? Do you need to be American to understand the significance? Not enough sharpness, and the stone is burnt out. The grass showing above the horizon looks haphazard, and distracts the eye. Lighting is not very effective. 2</td>', 'I''m afraid this picture leaves me very little to coneect with... who was George Rowland? What Indian wars? Do you need to be American to understand the significance? Not enough sharpness, and the stone is burnt out. The grass showing above the horizon looks haphazard, and distracts the eye. Lighting is not very effective. 2', '2003-08-26 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(399688, 34813, 5728, '<td valign="top">Go Jed! Everything is fully in focus, good stuff.</td>', 'Go Jed! Everything is fully in focus, good stuff.', '2003-08-26 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(399689, 34911, 8522, '<td valign="top">Difficult to make out what we''re seeing here. I presume there must be a rose involved, judging by your title. Highlights are burnt out. Picture seems very noisy. Why are there toes on the left? Very baffling shot... 3</td>', 'Difficult to make out what we''re seeing here. I presume there must be a rose involved, judging by your title. Highlights are burnt out. Picture seems very noisy. Why are there toes on the left? Very baffling shot... 3', '2003-08-26 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(399690, 34916, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure what we''re looking at here, or if it qualifies as a monument to me. Subject needs to stand out more from the background. The background elements at the bottom don''t add to the picture. Looks a bit too much like a snapshot, hard to see any effective composition here. 3</td>', 'Not sure what we''re looking at here, or if it qualifies as a monument to me. Subject needs to stand out more from the background. The background elements at the bottom don''t add to the picture. Looks a bit too much like a snapshot, hard to see any effective composition here. 3', '2003-08-26 10:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(399713, 34687, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting ''monument'' here... I believe that the time of day you chose to make this photograph may not have been the best since your primary building face is in the shadows.  The ''bright'' side of the building on the right side of the frame seems to be drawing my attention moreson than the dark side in the shadows...</td>', 'interesting ''monument'' here... I believe that the time of day you chose to make this photograph may not have been the best since your primary building face is in the shadows.  The ''bright'' side of the building on the right side of the frame seems to be drawing my attention moreson than the dark side in the shadows...', '2003-08-26 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399715, 34837, 6521, '<td valign="top">Virkilega skemmtileg mynd!</td>', 'Virkilega skemmtileg mynd!', '2003-08-26 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399717, 34864, 6521, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-08-26 11:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(399722, 34867, 6521, '<td valign="top">love it!!<br/> <br/>This is the most beautiful house in the world!</td>', 'love it!! This is the most beautiful house in the world!', '2003-08-26 11:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399724, 34875, 6521, '<td valign="top">Great colors</td>', 'Great colors', '2003-08-26 11:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(399732, 34221, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice angle/lighting.  Did you set up the light, or is it always there on the statue?</td>', 'Nice angle/lighting.  Did you set up the light, or is it always there on the statue?', '2003-08-26 11:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(399735, 34864, 7350, '<td valign="top">Exposure is perfect, and I think the background has just the right focus. 9.</td>', 'Exposure is perfect, and I think the background has just the right focus. 9.', '2003-08-26 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(399739, 34768, 772, '<td valign="top">This monument looks interesting, but maybe a closer view or some ''non literal'' view would accent the meaning and beauty of this particular piece...</td>', 'This monument looks interesting, but maybe a closer view or some ''non literal'' view would accent the meaning and beauty of this particular piece...', '2003-08-26 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(399741, 34900, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the mood that the glare spot gives.</td>', 'I like the mood that the glare spot gives.', '2003-08-26 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(399746, 34491, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent choice of perspective for this photograph.  The lighting creates nice shadows and contrast...</td>', 'excellent choice of perspective for this photograph.  The lighting creates nice shadows and contrast...', '2003-08-26 11:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(399752, 34646, 7350, '<td valign="top">He looks like he''s in a hurry.  Nice angle. 8.</td>', 'He looks like he''s in a hurry.  Nice angle. 8.', '2003-08-26 11:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(399757, 34789, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve gotten tons of comments to this effect, but it was 9-11-2001, not 2003.  The date you''ve put hasn''t even come yet - it''s in the future.  Still, good picture of a moving monument.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve gotten tons of comments to this effect, but it was 9-11-2001, not 2003.  The date you''ve put hasn''t even come yet - it''s in the future.  Still, good picture of a moving monument.', '2003-08-26 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(399759, 34654, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast. The blue sky really highlights your statue well.</td>', 'Nice color contrast. The blue sky really highlights your statue well.', '2003-08-26 11:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(399761, 34886, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition is good here as is the color combination. The sky appears a tad too grainy on my monitor for some reason.</td>', 'The composition is good here as is the color combination. The sky appears a tad too grainy on my monitor for some reason.', '2003-08-26 11:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(399764, 34176, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good "fill the frame" pic. The crack along the left side of the statue gives your image that extra boost.</td>', 'Good "fill the frame" pic. The crack along the left side of the statue gives your image that extra boost.', '2003-08-26 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
