(401039, 34368, 6888, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, would much rather have seen a photograph of an actual monument though, but for what its worht this is a decent photo</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, would much rather have seen a photograph of an actual monument though, but for what its worht this is a decent photo', '2003-08-27 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(401042, 34875, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, the lighting really worked well for you on this shot, well done</td>', 'Composition is good, the lighting really worked well for you on this shot, well done', '2003-08-27 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(401044, 34632, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, very nice contrast against the sky, focus looks good, crisp clear shot, well done</td>', 'Composition is good, very nice contrast against the sky, focus looks good, crisp clear shot, well done', '2003-08-27 11:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(401046, 34507, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, appears to be a bit over exposed, that really takes away from this</td>', 'Composition is good, appears to be a bit over exposed, that really takes away from this', '2003-08-27 11:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(401048, 34715, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, good DOF, building appears to be well in focus, photo is crisp and clear, well done</td>', 'Composition is good, good DOF, building appears to be well in focus, photo is crisp and clear, well done', '2003-08-27 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(401053, 34748, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, background is very nice, there really is almost too much going on to try to grab your attention, but i think what is saving it is the splash of sun on the dam wall keeps drwing me back to the dam, which is the main focus of the shot and for that I commend you</td>', 'Composition is good, background is very nice, there really is almost too much going on to try to grab your attention, but i think what is saving it is the splash of sun on the dam wall keeps drwing me back to the dam, which is the main focus of the shot and for that I commend you', '2003-08-27 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(401056, 34502, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, coloring is nice, maybe would have gone for a more blurred background but overall a nice job</td>', 'Composition is good, coloring is nice, maybe would have gone for a more blurred background but overall a nice job', '2003-08-27 11:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(401063, 34894, 6888, '<td valign="top">Composition is well done, there is a lot going on with the sky changing on you and the shadow of the trees but seemed to handle it well keeping pretty constant with the coloring on your monument, nice job</td>', 'Composition is well done, there is a lot going on with the sky changing on you and the shadow of the trees but seemed to handle it well keeping pretty constant with the coloring on your monument, nice job', '2003-08-27 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(401570, 34587, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The contrast of the lighthouse against the sky is quite striking and I think placing it off to one side was perfect.  I looks a little tilted to the left but I think that may be an illusion caused by the shape of the building, since the steps seem to be level with the bottom of the photo.  Weird effect.  Anyway, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'I like this very much. The contrast of the lighthouse against the sky is quite striking and I think placing it off to one side was perfect.  I looks a little tilted to the left but I think that may be an illusion caused by the shape of the building, since the steps seem to be level with the bottom of the photo.  Weird effect.  Anyway, this is one of my favorites of the challenge.', '2003-08-27 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(401589, 34832, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this statue in person and I love how you''ve captured it here.  Having the upstretched body and arm cut through the photo the way you have it is terrific and I like how you cut off the top of the ball, even further emphasizing the heights that Michael Jordan could reach. The light captures the details of the sculpture nicely too. This is a shot any Bulls fan would appreciate.</td>', 'I''ve seen this statue in person and I love how you''ve captured it here.  Having the upstretched body and arm cut through the photo the way you have it is terrific and I like how you cut off the top of the ball, even further emphasizing the heights that Michael Jordan could reach. The light captures the details of the sculpture nicely too. This is a shot any Bulls fan would appreciate.', '2003-08-27 15:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(401598, 34532, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully captured image of this monument.  I like brown and gold tones and the softness of the contrasts.  I can easily picture this enlarged and framed, hanging on the wall of an executive office or dining room.  I hope I remember to come back and and this to my favorites after the challenge because it certainly is.</td>', 'This is a beautifully captured image of this monument.  I like brown and gold tones and the softness of the contrasts.  I can easily picture this enlarged and framed, hanging on the wall of an executive office or dining room.  I hope I remember to come back and and this to my favorites after the challenge because it certainly is.', '2003-08-27 15:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(401606, 34773, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like your choice to shoot this on an upward angle and use the sepia tones.  The angle and straight lines of the church in the background is a very striking contrast to the softer curves of the statue.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I like your choice to shoot this on an upward angle and use the sepia tones.  The angle and straight lines of the church in the background is a very striking contrast to the softer curves of the statue.  Very nicely done.', '2003-08-27 15:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(401775, 34532, 10263, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this sillhouetted against the sky with no ground showing. Or only a low horizon.  I love the tones</td>', 'I would love to see this sillhouetted against the sky with no ground showing. Or only a low horizon.  I love the tones', '2003-08-27 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(401851, 34807, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, the dark background makes the buildings spring out in a majestic way. Almost no blowouts, they are so easy to get with all these different lights around buildings.<br/>I don''t like how the left is cut off, but keystoning and other distortion problems aren''t visible = good. Outside dpc I''d clone the red info sign out of the lower left window.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great lighting, the dark background makes the buildings spring out in a majestic way. Almost no blowouts, they are so easy to get with all these different lights around buildings.I don''t like how the left is cut off, but keystoning and other distortion problems aren''t visible = good. Outside dpc I''d clone the red info sign out of the lower left window. ', '2003-08-27 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(401853, 34429, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good idea to include the people in front. Brings the place alive. Nice how you framed the statue.</td>', 'Good idea to include the people in front. Brings the place alive. Nice how you framed the statue.', '2003-08-27 18:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(401857, 34877, 11654, '<td valign="top">Outstanding clarity!  Contrast is good except for left edge behind scoreboard.  Perhaps an evening photo or an angle 30degrees west would have perfected this.</td>', 'Outstanding clarity!  Contrast is good except for left edge behind scoreboard.  Perhaps an evening photo or an angle 30degrees west would have perfected this.', '2003-08-27 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(401876, 34538, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool composition, seems to show off the height.</td>', 'Cool composition, seems to show off the height.', '2003-08-27 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(401885, 34896, 3032, '<td valign="top">Awesome:<br/>* Great profile<br/>* Great colors<br/>* Very good composition. I particularly like it how you got the statue looking towards the sun, creating an invisible leading line.</td>', 'Awesome:* Great profile* Great colors* Very good composition. I particularly like it how you got the statue looking towards the sun, creating an invisible leading line.', '2003-08-27 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(401886, 34115, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed. Original.</td>', 'Great idea, well executed. Original.', '2003-08-27 18:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(401900, 34823, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting. The gold probably easily causes blown out patches, hardly seen here. The most interesting effect is on the carrying structure below it. It almost looks like gold tinted Infrared output, pretty amazing and perhaps worth a photo itself.</td>', 'Interesting lighting. The gold probably easily causes blown out patches, hardly seen here. The most interesting effect is on the carrying structure below it. It almost looks like gold tinted Infrared output, pretty amazing and perhaps worth a photo itself.', '2003-08-27 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(401916, 34632, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful composition but it may be just a tad underexposed for my taste.  I''m not sure if it''s underexposure or maybe just an overall lack of contrast, but the monument choice here is beautiful :) = 9</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful composition but it may be just a tad underexposed for my taste.  I''m not sure if it''s underexposure or maybe just an overall lack of contrast, but the monument choice here is beautiful :) = 9', '2003-08-27 19:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(401920, 34666, 3032, '<td valign="top">I think I discussed this subject earlier with you. This angle of view and execution is very good.</td>', 'I think I discussed this subject earlier with you. This angle of view and execution is very good.', '2003-08-27 19:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(401973, 34792, 10263, '<td valign="top">Unusual tombstone. I think more contrast would be good. It definately fits the challenge.</td>', 'Unusual tombstone. I think more contrast would be good. It definately fits the challenge.', '2003-08-27 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(401977, 34901, 9241, '<td valign="top">very unusaul perspective, kinda looks like a dwarf</td>', 'very unusaul perspective, kinda looks like a dwarf', '2003-08-27 20:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(401979, 34401, 9241, '<td valign="top">classic, a little less dead tree and more of that perfect sky would be nice</td>', 'classic, a little less dead tree and more of that perfect sky would be nice', '2003-08-27 20:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(401981, 34900, 9241, '<td valign="top">ghostly otherworldly</td>', 'ghostly otherworldly', '2003-08-27 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(401984, 34115, 9241, '<td valign="top">interesting architechture, kinda overexposed at the sky. perhaps a spot metering and exposure for the sky?</td>', 'interesting architechture, kinda overexposed at the sky. perhaps a spot metering and exposure for the sky?', '2003-08-27 20:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(401986, 34429, 9241, '<td valign="top">nice, college campus? I like the interaction of the real world with the monument, or lack of it</td>', 'nice, college campus? I like the interaction of the real world with the monument, or lack of it', '2003-08-27 21:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(401989, 34905, 9241, '<td valign="top">nice monument, try shooting with the sun to your back to reduce glare. I know then you wouldnt get his face. Timing</td>', 'nice monument, try shooting with the sun to your back to reduce glare. I know then you wouldnt get his face. Timing', '2003-08-27 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(401998, 34909, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo.. the silhouette concept here works very well against the ''stormy'' sky... nice work :)</td>', 'excellent photo.. the silhouette concept here works very well against the ''stormy'' sky... nice work :)', '2003-08-27 21:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(402000, 34659, 7414, '<td valign="top">nice use of infrared... 7</td>', 'nice use of infrared... 7', '2003-08-27 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(402001, 34861, 7414, '<td valign="top">a bit noisy</td>', 'a bit noisy', '2003-08-27 21:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(402084, 34864, 7810, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the subject... Having lost a few along the way this picture tugged a bit at the heart strings...well done!</td>', 'Very nice take on the subject... Having lost a few along the way this picture tugged a bit at the heart strings...well done!', '2003-08-27 22:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402086, 34899, 7810, '<td valign="top">love the lighting nice image</td>', 'love the lighting nice image', '2003-08-27 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402089, 34666, 7810, '<td valign="top">excellent work...great take on the subject</td>', 'excellent work...great take on the subject', '2003-08-27 22:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(402090, 34865, 7810, '<td valign="top">love the idea of this shot...wish the graves were in better focus</td>', 'love the idea of this shot...wish the graves were in better focus', '2003-08-27 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(402091, 34538, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice image</td>', 'nice image', '2003-08-27 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402112, 34880, 6405, '<td valign="top">9 Here!</td>', '9 Here!', '2003-08-27 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(402138, 34532, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the old feel of this image. Well composed.</td>', 'I like the old feel of this image. Well composed.', '2003-08-28 00:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(402181, 34221, 6325, '<td valign="top">Too bad everyone can''t see the sclae of this statue.</td>', 'Too bad everyone can''t see the sclae of this statue.', '2003-08-28 00:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(402227, 34665, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! Great job of preserving the contrast between the sky/clouds and the statue.</td>', 'This is a great shot! Great job of preserving the contrast between the sky/clouds and the statue.', '2003-08-28 01:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(402229, 34538, 8054, '<td valign="top">I''m usually a sucker for a great perspective shot such as this but the sky has a bit too much noise in it. Excellent job, however!</td>', 'I''m usually a sucker for a great perspective shot such as this but the sky has a bit too much noise in it. Excellent job, however!', '2003-08-28 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(402233, 34861, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like the image is tilted to the left a bit and the sky shows compression artifacts. Trees are a bit blurry. If those were not present, I''d rate this picture much higher.</td>', 'Looks like the image is tilted to the left a bit and the sky shows compression artifacts. Trees are a bit blurry. If those were not present, I''d rate this picture much higher.', '2003-08-28 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402235, 34715, 8054, '<td valign="top">This looks outstanding in black and white! Gives it a very antique look. However, the trees are a bit blurred.</td>', 'This looks outstanding in black and white! Gives it a very antique look. However, the trees are a bit blurred.', '2003-08-28 01:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(402236, 34837, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field! Keeps the focus on the foreground cross.</td>', 'Good use of depth of field! Keeps the focus on the foreground cross.', '2003-08-28 01:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(402241, 34817, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter but remember the rule of thirds. That was one of my mistakes.  :)</td>', 'Great subject matter but remember the rule of thirds. That was one of my mistakes.  :)', '2003-08-28 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(402243, 34869, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Looks like it''s a bit overexposed.', '2003-08-28 01:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(402245, 34883, 8054, '<td valign="top">Hmm, am I the only one who thinks this is way too phallic?</td>', 'Hmm, am I the only one who thinks this is way too phallic?', '2003-08-28 01:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402247, 34864, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great image! The title matches the picture perfectly.</td>', 'Great image! The title matches the picture perfectly.', '2003-08-28 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(402250, 34632, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle. The image looks a bit dark/underexposed but not by much.</td>', 'Interesting angle. The image looks a bit dark/underexposed but not by much.', '2003-08-28 01:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(402252, 34894, 8054, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective. Now the bad: sky looks a bit over exposed or maybe the focus is off. The details where the leaves meet sky/cloud are blurry. And the people: I usually try to wait for a people-free shot.</td>', 'Awesome perspective. Now the bad: sky looks a bit over exposed or maybe the focus is off. The details where the leaves meet sky/cloud are blurry. And the people: I usually try to wait for a people-free shot.', '2003-08-28 01:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402259, 34883, 2923, '<td valign="top">cute :-)</td>', 'cute :-)', '2003-08-28 02:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(402265, 34556, 8054, '<td valign="top">Do visitors touch Mr. Lincoln''s nose a lot or is that just a weird shadow?</td>', 'Do visitors touch Mr. Lincoln''s nose a lot or is that just a weird shadow?', '2003-08-28 02:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(402266, 34727, 8054, '<td valign="top">Impressive! I like how the reflecting pool is actually doing what it was intended to do. Great job.</td>', 'Impressive! I like how the reflecting pool is actually doing what it was intended to do. Great job.', '2003-08-28 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(402330, 34587, 9758, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast in this shot. Good luck</td>', 'Love the contrast in this shot. Good luck', '2003-08-28 03:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(402332, 34433, 9758, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I really like the composition of this shot! The lighting is very effective. Good luck</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I really like the composition of this shot! The lighting is very effective. Good luck', '2003-08-28 03:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(402333, 34837, 9758, '<td valign="top">Very strong image. I love the leading line. Good luck</td>', 'Very strong image. I love the leading line. Good luck', '2003-08-28 03:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(402334, 34773, 9758, '<td valign="top">What  a powerful image! I like the sepia tones. Good luck</td>', 'What  a powerful image! I like the sepia tones. Good luck', '2003-08-28 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402351, 34318, 3585, '<td valign="top">Now, finaly someone comes out with some quality negative space, that stands alone as a independent graphical element and enhances the main subjet at the same time.</td>', 'Now, finaly someone comes out with some quality negative space, that stands alone as a independent graphical element and enhances the main subjet at the same time.', '2003-08-28 04:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(402359, 34563, 9758, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the angle of the shot. Are you one of those Icelanders?</td>', 'Very nice, I like the angle of the shot. Are you one of those Icelanders?', '2003-08-28 04:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(402360, 34823, 9758, '<td valign="top">I like the gold colors, good call to take this shot at night. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the gold colors, good call to take this shot at night. Good luck.', '2003-08-28 04:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(402361, 34807, 9758, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this shot. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this shot. Good luck.', '2003-08-28 04:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(402362, 34819, 9758, '<td valign="top">Very original and funny! Good luck</td>', 'Very original and funny! Good luck', '2003-08-28 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402364, 34899, 9758, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I like the purple. Did you do a color shift?</td>', 'Very pretty, I like the purple. Did you do a color shift?', '2003-08-28 04:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(402365, 34867, 9758, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the composition and the barely visible Walt Disney on the wall.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the composition and the barely visible Walt Disney on the wall.', '2003-08-28 04:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(402366, 34556, 9758, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Good luck.</td>', 'Great composition! Good luck.', '2003-08-28 04:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(402367, 34538, 9758, '<td valign="top">Great angle! Good luck.</td>', 'Great angle! Good luck.', '2003-08-28 04:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(402436, 34532, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones of this picture.  Great backdrop too.  Nice work overall, especially that this picture works, being a little soft.</td>', 'I like the warm tones of this picture.  Great backdrop too.  Nice work overall, especially that this picture works, being a little soft.', '2003-08-28 05:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(402594, 34875, 7758, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, this is a very strong image and captured at a good time of day. Well balanced compositionally, I think this you have encapsulated the essence of this challenge and created an image that goes beyond a simple photograh of a monument. Love the lighting and the tones in this shot. Good Luck, Todd. 10.</td>', 'Excellent work, this is a very strong image and captured at a good time of day. Well balanced compositionally, I think this you have encapsulated the essence of this challenge and created an image that goes beyond a simple photograh of a monument. Love the lighting and the tones in this shot. Good Luck, Todd. 10.', '2003-08-28 10:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(402616, 34898, 11660, '<td valign="top">Great color, compelling subject</td>', 'Great color, compelling subject', '2003-08-28 11:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(402618, 34727, 11660, '<td valign="top">good use of color and reflection</td>', 'good use of color and reflection', '2003-08-28 11:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(402693, 34666, 7350, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfect.  I really like the border as well.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'The lighting is perfect.  I really like the border as well.  A 10 from me.', '2003-08-28 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(402699, 34665, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot.  I even like the little trees in the lower left.  They make him look much bigger and powerful. 9.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot.  I even like the little trees in the lower left.  They make him look much bigger and powerful. 9.', '2003-08-28 12:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(402700, 34507, 7350, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little too soft for my taste.  That may be intentional, but I don''t feel like it works here.</td>', 'Focus is a little too soft for my taste.  That may be intentional, but I don''t feel like it works here.', '2003-08-28 12:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(402732, 34887, 11678, '<td valign="top">Low angle sun shots always get to me. Nicely done.</td>', 'Low angle sun shots always get to me. Nicely done.', '2003-08-28 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(402972, 34883, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very Phallic. Humor aside, I''d argue that there''e too much negative space. Tighter crop might be more effective.</td>', 'Very Phallic. Humor aside, I''d argue that there''e too much negative space. Tighter crop might be more effective.', '2003-08-28 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(402975, 34820, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice! In my mind, this is an excellent example of good negative space usage. Also love the colors.</td>', 'Nice! In my mind, this is an excellent example of good negative space usage. Also love the colors.', '2003-08-28 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(402979, 34909, 7560, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot, but it ends up being too dark. The one advantage of the clouds is they are somewhat reminicent of clouds of smoke at a fire. This monument might be worth doing a study on in various weather conditions. I think there''s a great shot to be had here.</td>', 'Dramatic shot, but it ends up being too dark. The one advantage of the clouds is they are somewhat reminicent of clouds of smoke at a fire. This monument might be worth doing a study on in various weather conditions. I think there''s a great shot to be had here.', '2003-08-28 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(402984, 34887, 7560, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot, excellent lighting. I''d like it more with the trees on the right not breaking up the line of the fort.</td>', 'Dramatic shot, excellent lighting. I''d like it more with the trees on the right not breaking up the line of the fort.', '2003-08-28 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(402986, 34861, 7560, '<td valign="top">Needs a rotation to the right and possibly a UV Haze filter. Pretty standard shot. A polorizing filter might help give it some pop.</td>', 'Needs a rotation to the right and possibly a UV Haze filter. Pretty standard shot. A polorizing filter might help give it some pop.', '2003-08-28 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(402988, 34665, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice, dramatic. Good use of fill flash. I like the almost cross like trees to the left. 6</td>', 'Nice, dramatic. Good use of fill flash. I like the almost cross like trees to the left. 6', '2003-08-28 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(402991, 34889, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very postcard. Bright, saturated colors. I''d like to see what you can do getting closer, or trying different angles.</td>', 'Very postcard. Bright, saturated colors. I''d like to see what you can do getting closer, or trying different angles.', '2003-08-28 16:03:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(402992, 34778, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice monument and I like the framing. The background blows out the photo though.</td>', 'Nice monument and I like the framing. The background blows out the photo though.', '2003-08-28 16:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(402997, 34612, 6100, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured nice detail and textures.</td>', 'You''ve captured nice detail and textures.', '2003-08-28 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(402998, 34646, 7560, '<td valign="top">Interesting tilt. It gives the image a sense of motion that would be lacking in a straight vertical orientation. Nice. 7</td>', 'Interesting tilt. It gives the image a sense of motion that would be lacking in a straight vertical orientation. Nice. 7', '2003-08-28 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(403002, 34137, 7560, '<td valign="top">the maker for this image is the two people walking towars the church. It introduces a nice element of perspective.</td>', 'the maker for this image is the two people walking towars the church. It introduces a nice element of perspective.', '2003-08-28 16:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(403013, 34877, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. As a baseball fan it coverst both the past and present. I love the detail, and I love the subject. Coming in spikes high...The only two things that get me are the left foot (because of the light sky, the spikes dissapear) and it feels slightly sharp. 9</td>', 'I love this shot. As a baseball fan it coverst both the past and present. I love the detail, and I love the subject. Coming in spikes high...The only two things that get me are the left foot (because of the light sky, the spikes dissapear) and it feels slightly sharp. 9', '2003-08-28 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(403017, 34727, 7560, '<td valign="top">Thank god the crane is finally down. I''ve been trying to get this shot for months! You beat me to it. Nice capure and use of the reflection. I think the image could be stronger if you tried to keep strict symmetry including the trees on the right in your crop. You also might need a slight rotation. Great shot. 8</td>', 'Thank god the crane is finally down. I''ve been trying to get this shot for months! You beat me to it. Nice capure and use of the reflection. I think the image could be stronger if you tried to keep strict symmetry including the trees on the right in your crop. You also might need a slight rotation. Great shot. 8', '2003-08-28 16:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(403020, 34896, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, use of shadow, and negative space. Makes me wonder what he''s looking at, what he''s thinking. My 10 for the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, use of shadow, and negative space. Makes me wonder what he''s looking at, what he''s thinking. My 10 for the challenge.', '2003-08-28 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(403021, 34221, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the dark blue sky, and orange-yellow backlighting.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the dark blue sky, and orange-yellow backlighting.', '2003-08-28 16:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(403023, 34875, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the lighting.', '2003-08-28 16:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(403151, 34557, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautifully taken image.<br/>And yet I feel the title is very detrimental. Far better (in my opinion) to put only the title of the monument, and add, at most, the name of the country. People can look up the significance if they wish. <br/>I certainly don''t think it''s helpful to add the height - it seems to me like an instruction to the viewer on how to "see" the image.<br/>That said, it''s an attractive image, nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'A beautifully taken image.And yet I feel the title is very detrimental. Far better (in my opinion) to put only the title of the monument, and add, at most, the name of the country. People can look up the significance if they wish. I certainly don''t think it''s helpful to add the height - it seems to me like an instruction to the viewer on how to "see" the image.That said, it''s an attractive image, nice lighting and composition.', '2003-08-28 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(403328, 34875, 2716, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the soft colors in this picture.  very nice.  ONe of my favorites.  10.  Jacko.</td>', 'I absolutely love the soft colors in this picture.  very nice.  ONe of my favorites.  10.  Jacko.', '2003-08-28 22:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
