(403914, 34806, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hard shot to comment on, it could be cropped slightly more on bottom,(small white parts are distracting a little, the sky and clouds are nice. The focus seems soft, but perhaps is intentional.  Just my opinion</td>', 'Hard shot to comment on, it could be cropped slightly more on bottom,(small white parts are distracting a little, the sky and clouds are nice. The focus seems soft, but perhaps is intentional.  Just my opinion', '2003-08-29 15:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(403916, 34727, 7857, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats an amazing reflection and a nice colour gradient in the sky. I think this is lacking something, but thats probably just because you need to include so much background to fit in the whole monument + reflection. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Wow, thats an amazing reflection and a nice colour gradient in the sky. I think this is lacking something, but thats probably just because you need to include so much background to fit in the whole monument + reflection. Good luck with it.', '2003-08-29 15:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
