(403921, 34909, 7969, '<td valign="top">wishing for a little more light on the monument to catch some detail, but I like the idea of this shot. Composition is good too, It makes me curious as to how high the ladder is below.  Good angle.</td>', 'wishing for a little more light on the monument to catch some detail, but I like the idea of this shot. Composition is good too, It makes me curious as to how high the ladder is below.  Good angle.', '2003-08-29 15:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
