(403931, 34789, 7969, '<td valign="top">Would of liked to have seen a more vertical shot, cropping out the ''hats''  despite them being part of memorial, leaves too much to focus on and the middle part is really the strongest image, also had it been shot in portrait mode the background would of become blurred and less distracting.  just some thoughts  :  )</td>', 'Would of liked to have seen a more vertical shot, cropping out the ''hats''  despite them being part of memorial, leaves too much to focus on and the middle part is really the strongest image, also had it been shot in portrait mode the background would of become blurred and less distracting.  just some thoughts  :  )', '2003-08-29 15:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(403934, 34773, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting monument I like that it is up close and the angle which you shot from, I dont even mind the more overexposed bits on top too much.</td>', 'This is an interesting monument I like that it is up close and the angle which you shot from, I dont even mind the more overexposed bits on top too much.', '2003-08-29 15:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
