(403953, 34898, 7969, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here, would like to see it closer, without the wall perhaps and maybe with no tree on top too.  Closer would probably put the subject in closer focus too.</td>', 'Too much going on here, would like to see it closer, without the wall perhaps and maybe with no tree on top too.  Closer would probably put the subject in closer focus too.', '2003-08-29 15:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
