(404023, 34318, 7969, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract, not sure what the monument is (though not important i guess), I love the clouds.  I don''t particularly like the format or the border.  The border IMO distracts from your image vs. enhances it.</td>', 'An interesting abstract, not sure what the monument is (though not important i guess), I love the clouds.  I don''t particularly like the format or the border.  The border IMO distracts from your image vs. enhances it.', '2003-08-29 17:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
