(404028, 34899, 7969, '<td valign="top">The part of this photo IMO which has the most ''wow'' potential is the lower middle part with the shadows.  All the light (and interest IMO) is there.  I would love to see this re-shot or cropped to highlight only that area.  It would add detail to the monument and give more of a focus to that really spectacular area.  I actually tried cropping here, and it is very pixelized, but the potential is clear, if you ever reshoot it I would love to see it.</td>', 'The part of this photo IMO which has the most ''wow'' potential is the lower middle part with the shadows.  All the light (and interest IMO) is there.  I would love to see this re-shot or cropped to highlight only that area.  It would add detail to the monument and give more of a focus to that really spectacular area.  I actually tried cropping here, and it is very pixelized, but the potential is clear, if you ever reshoot it I would love to see it.', '2003-08-29 17:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(404031, 34676, 7969, '<td valign="top">Not a reall wow shot but nice to see such a historical monument, I like the broken nose.  tones are good, slightly off center, maybe thats intentional, good job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Not a reall wow shot but nice to see such a historical monument, I like the broken nose.  tones are good, slightly off center, maybe thats intentional, good job. ', '2003-08-29 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
