(404044, 34454, 7969, '<td valign="top">Would of cropped out the top line, there is alredy enough to look at in the bottom, and top just distracts from subject.  The cross is cropped too tight on the left I think. Just my opinion</td>', 'Would of cropped out the top line, there is alredy enough to look at in the bottom, and top just distracts from subject.  The cross is cropped too tight on the left I think. Just my opinion', '2003-08-29 17:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
