(404284, 34659, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is the shot normally i think i would like, my impression is that it does not match, (but what do I know).  Explanation:  I feel like the leaves have a luminous quality, which i really like, they are light and airy. The sculpture however is dark and heavy.  Which I also like.  But together they feel conflicted to me. Especially with leaves being on both sides, my focus feels pulled back and forth.  I think you are attempting something here which is just on the edge of something great, like to see some similar shots with different tones/effects.</td>', 'This is the shot normally i think i would like, my impression is that it does not match, (but what do I know).  Explanation:  I feel like the leaves have a luminous quality, which i really like, they are light and airy. The sculpture however is dark and heavy.  Which I also like.  But together they feel conflicted to me. Especially with leaves being on both sides, my focus feels pulled back and forth.  I think you are attempting something here which is just on the edge of something great, like to see some similar shots with different tones/effects.', '2003-08-29 21:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
