(404679, 34559, 7857, '<td valign="top">I love the totally abstract background you''ve been able to create here. Nice vibrant colours and the white does a great job of emphasising the different colours. Good luck with it.</td>', 'I love the totally abstract background you''ve been able to create here. Nice vibrant colours and the white does a great job of emphasising the different colours. Good luck with it.', '2003-08-30 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(404727, 34659, 778, '<td valign="top">My only 10!  I find the photo draws me into the focus of the archway!  The quality presented by the b/w is stunning and utilizing the trees for a natural framing always works for me!  Great shot!</td>', 'My only 10!  I find the photo draws me into the focus of the archway!  The quality presented by the b/w is stunning and utilizing the trees for a natural framing always works for me!  Great shot!', '2003-08-30 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(404728, 34837, 778, '<td valign="top">I love your angle and focal point!  A wise choice for this subject matter...which by the way is significant.  I find this a solid monument photo and great overall photo!  Great work!</td>', 'I love your angle and focal point!  A wise choice for this subject matter...which by the way is significant.  I find this a solid monument photo and great overall photo!  Great work!', '2003-08-30 16:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(404749, 34875, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great lighting 9</td>', 'Great lighting 9', '2003-08-30 17:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(404750, 34221, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very clean and sharp with perfect lighting. 9</td>', 'Very clean and sharp with perfect lighting. 9', '2003-08-30 17:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(404757, 34727, 2333, '<td valign="top">You found some beautiful light for this shot. Nice use of symmetry.</td>', 'You found some beautiful light for this shot. Nice use of symmetry.', '2003-08-30 17:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(404759, 34539, 2333, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant interpretation of the subject. I like the vertical orientation and the jet black background.</td>', 'Simple, elegant interpretation of the subject. I like the vertical orientation and the jet black background.', '2003-08-30 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(404763, 34877, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nice crop. Perfect use of DoF, retians the scoreboard as an element of the photo, not totally blurrred, but emphasizes the subject.  Diffuse light is very nice. A sunny day would have been bad news for this shot!</td>', 'Nice crop. Perfect use of DoF, retians the scoreboard as an element of the photo, not totally blurrred, but emphasizes the subject.  Diffuse light is very nice. A sunny day would have been bad news for this shot!', '2003-08-30 17:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(404765, 34748, 2333, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure. Crop works pretty well. I wonder if maybe a portrait orientation would have had more impact, emphasize the height of the dam?</td>', 'Perfect exposure. Crop works pretty well. I wonder if maybe a portrait orientation would have had more impact, emphasize the height of the dam?', '2003-08-30 17:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(404767, 34221, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nice intrepretation of the subject; the lighting just makes this shot for me. Did you provide the front and/or side lighting on the statue? <br/>Only impovement I could imagine would be a little more of the front light on his head/face.</td>', 'Nice intrepretation of the subject; the lighting just makes this shot for me. Did you provide the front and/or side lighting on the statue? Only impovement I could imagine would be a little more of the front light on his head/face.', '2003-08-30 17:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(404773, 34221, 7304, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Your exposure was on.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Your exposure was on.', '2003-08-30 18:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(404774, 34864, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The red is very powerful.</td>', 'Nice shot. The red is very powerful.', '2003-08-30 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(404775, 34837, 7304, '<td valign="top">Says a lot.</td>', 'Says a lot.', '2003-08-30 18:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(404776, 34883, 7304, '<td valign="top">What a symbol and statement.</td>', 'What a symbol and statement.', '2003-08-30 18:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(404777, 34553, 7304, '<td valign="top">My heart goes out to all the military and this is a very powerful image that shows all the branches. I serve now and this is emotional to me but I salute them and I salute you for a great shot.<br/> <br/>Robert Moore-Sgt</td>', 'My heart goes out to all the military and this is a very powerful image that shows all the branches. I serve now and this is emotional to me but I salute them and I salute you for a great shot. Robert Moore-Sgt', '2003-08-30 18:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(404778, 34877, 7304, '<td valign="top">The best. You should win!!!!! This is an excellent shot.</td>', 'The best. You should win!!!!! This is an excellent shot.', '2003-08-30 18:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(404779, 34176, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice crop. Nice use of the crack for the tear. Very powerful.</td>', 'Nice crop. Nice use of the crack for the tear. Very powerful.', '2003-08-30 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(404785, 34896, 7304, '<td valign="top">Just thinking of that time in war, it was difficult, and just to see the sunset at the end of the day was what each soldier wanted to see but many never made it and Stonewall had to live with those feelings. Nice shot. Tells a story. Great composition.</td>', 'Just thinking of that time in war, it was difficult, and just to see the sunset at the end of the day was what each soldier wanted to see but many never made it and Stonewall had to live with those feelings. Nice shot. Tells a story. Great composition.', '2003-08-30 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(404788, 34778, 7857, '<td valign="top">I like the harsh contrast here (esp between the true black of the leaves and the sky) even though I have no idea what the monument is. Nice shot, good luck with it.</td>', 'I like the harsh contrast here (esp between the true black of the leaves and the sky) even though I have no idea what the monument is. Nice shot, good luck with it.', '2003-08-30 18:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(404789, 34837, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, and very nice detail picked up within the focal area. I think one of the things about this that really appeals to me is the worn quality in the paint which has lead to colours that work well into the back ground. I''m not sure thats come out the way I mean but in easier terms... great shot!</td>', 'Nice DOF, and very nice detail picked up within the focal area. I think one of the things about this that really appeals to me is the worn quality in the paint which has lead to colours that work well into the back ground. I''m not sure thats come out the way I mean but in easier terms... great shot!', '2003-08-30 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(404794, 34687, 7857, '<td valign="top">I keep starting to lean over when I look at this because of the slight slope on that far wall but I guess the problem is trying to get a balance between both sides. Definately a good subject choice, good luck.</td>', 'I keep starting to lean over when I look at this because of the slight slope on that far wall but I guess the problem is trying to get a balance between both sides. Definately a good subject choice, good luck.', '2003-08-30 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(404896, 34612, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but it is to processed for my taste.</td>', 'Nice pic but it is to processed for my taste.', '2003-08-30 20:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(404906, 34538, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo and a good perspective and composition! - 8</td>', 'Very cool photo and a good perspective and composition! - 8', '2003-08-30 20:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(404908, 34883, 10883, '<td valign="top">Man! I honestly laughed out loud when I saw this picture!  Don´t know if if will go very well down with some people here, but I like it!  Good sense of humor!<br/>This one would also have fitted quite nicely in the negative space challenge! :)</td>', 'Man! I honestly laughed out loud when I saw this picture!  Don´t know if if will go very well down with some people here, but I like it!  Good sense of humor!This one would also have fitted quite nicely in the negative space challenge! :)', '2003-08-30 20:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(404929, 34864, 11738, '<td valign="top">This photo is somewhat pleasing, but the sharpness of the branch and the soft focus of the tombstones takes away from the subject matter</td>', 'This photo is somewhat pleasing, but the sharpness of the branch and the soft focus of the tombstones takes away from the subject matter', '2003-08-30 21:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(404930, 34443, 11738, '<td valign="top">GIANT CHICKENS!!!  RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!!</td>', 'GIANT CHICKENS!!!  RUN FOR YOUR LIVES!!', '2003-08-30 21:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(404931, 34885, 11738, '<td valign="top">Flash lighting on this seesm to be a bit too sharp.  I would have put more emphasis on the statue and less on the plaques.  Interesting monument though</td>', 'Flash lighting on this seesm to be a bit too sharp.  I would have put more emphasis on the statue and less on the plaques.  Interesting monument though', '2003-08-30 21:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(404932, 34556, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up shot.  A bit overexposed on the nose.  Almost looks like a big-a$$ pigeon bullseyed him on the shnoz.</td>', 'Nice close-up shot.  A bit overexposed on the nose.  Almost looks like a big-a$$ pigeon bullseyed him on the shnoz.', '2003-08-30 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(404934, 34900, 11738, '<td valign="top">Black and white works well here.  Nice reflection off the roof too.  It would have been cool to have the sky a mauve or faint purple (purple haze).</td>', 'Black and white works well here.  Nice reflection off the roof too.  It would have been cool to have the sky a mauve or faint purple (purple haze).', '2003-08-30 21:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(404935, 34221, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky and lighting.  You picked a very good time of day to take this shot.</td>', 'Awesome sky and lighting.  You picked a very good time of day to take this shot.', '2003-08-30 21:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(404937, 34563, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Like how you waited until 08:00 to take the shot too.  Nice attention to details.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Like how you waited until 08:00 to take the shot too.  Nice attention to details.', '2003-08-30 21:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(404940, 34828, 11738, '<td valign="top">The angle of the building takes away from the shot... for me anyway.  Nice shot apart from that.</td>', 'The angle of the building takes away from the shot... for me anyway.  Nice shot apart from that.', '2003-08-30 21:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(404941, 34507, 11738, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a bit out focus.  I would have filled the frame a bit more with the statue to eliminate distractions from the surrounding buildings and tree.</td>', 'This seems to be a bit out focus.  I would have filled the frame a bit more with the statue to eliminate distractions from the surrounding buildings and tree.', '2003-08-30 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(404942, 34559, 11738, '<td valign="top">Woohoo. wild colours!</td>', 'Woohoo. wild colours!', '2003-08-30 21:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(404943, 34867, 11738, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots from the group.  You are lucky to have such interesting subject matter.</td>', 'One of the best shots from the group.  You are lucky to have such interesting subject matter.', '2003-08-30 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(404987, 34679, 11167, '<td valign="top">i like this picture.  very creative.</td>', 'i like this picture.  very creative.', '2003-08-31 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405025, 34368, 3577, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2003-08-31 02:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(405049, 34864, 3554, '<td valign="top">Creative submission. I like the focus on life over death. O think the placement of the branch in the frame works well in this shot. DOF is quite well done.</td>', 'Creative submission. I like the focus on life over death. O think the placement of the branch in the frame works well in this shot. DOF is quite well done.', '2003-08-31 05:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(405050, 34559, 3554, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of contrast and color. I personally don''t particularly care for it. I''m not sure what the purpose of the coloring is...</td>', 'Interesting use of contrast and color. I personally don''t particularly care for it. I''m not sure what the purpose of the coloring is...', '2003-08-31 05:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(405051, 34679, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think the glare on the left hurts this shot. Also a different angle might have been better so the shoes are less obtrusive.</td>', 'I think the glare on the left hurts this shot. Also a different angle might have been better so the shoes are less obtrusive.', '2003-08-31 05:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(405052, 34368, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the reddish orange cast on the coins. Perhaps a different white balance option to correct for (I''m guessing) tungsten lights?</td>', 'Not a big fan of the reddish orange cast on the coins. Perhaps a different white balance option to correct for (I''m guessing) tungsten lights?', '2003-08-31 05:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(405053, 34443, 3554, '<td valign="top">Feels like a snap shot. Too much going on in the background. Maybe a different angle and focus on part of the statue would have been better. Also if you could have blurred the background some it might have helped.</td>', 'Feels like a snap shot. Too much going on in the background. Maybe a different angle and focus on part of the statue would have been better. Also if you could have blurred the background some it might have helped.', '2003-08-31 05:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(405054, 34861, 3554, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening?  There''s quite a bit of pixilation in this one.</td>', 'Too much sharpening?  There''s quite a bit of pixilation in this one.', '2003-08-31 05:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(405055, 34587, 3554, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a bit sharper.</td>', 'I wish this were a bit sharper.', '2003-08-31 05:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(405056, 34897, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if you had trimmed the rust spot out of the shot (top right-middle)</td>', 'I think it would be better if you had trimmed the rust spot out of the shot (top right-middle)', '2003-08-31 05:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(405071, 34911, 11738, '<td valign="top">A novel approach and it works for me.  One of the best of the series</td>', 'A novel approach and it works for me.  One of the best of the series', '2003-08-31 07:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(405072, 34877, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting.  I like how the screboard was incorporated into the background with just enough sharp focus to tell what it is.</td>', 'This is very interesting.  I like how the screboard was incorporated into the background with just enough sharp focus to tell what it is.', '2003-08-31 07:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(405073, 34176, 11738, '<td valign="top">Great choice of title and nice work framing the subject.  One of the best of the series, maybe even the winner.</td>', 'Great choice of title and nice work framing the subject.  One of the best of the series, maybe even the winner.', '2003-08-31 08:00:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(405082, 34748, 3540, '<td valign="top">The shadows are too much.  They seem to really weight the image down.   I also wish it would''ve shown the whole dam.  It looks so impressive.  I''m not sure how much of it would fit in the frame either because of  where you can and can''t take pictures there.</td>', 'The shadows are too much.  They seem to really weight the image down.   I also wish it would''ve shown the whole dam.  It looks so impressive.  I''m not sure how much of it would fit in the frame either because of  where you can and can''t take pictures there.', '2003-08-31 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(405083, 34221, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs a little light coming in from the left to show his face just a little more.  I don''t think the rest of him needs it, but the face should be lit.  Awesome colors.  I like what you did with the lighting thats in the pic now, but I think it needs just a little extra on his face.</td>', 'This needs a little light coming in from the left to show his face just a little more.  I don''t think the rest of him needs it, but the face should be lit.  Awesome colors.  I like what you did with the lighting thats in the pic now, but I think it needs just a little extra on his face.', '2003-08-31 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(405084, 34899, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo needs to be so much bigger.  There is a ton of details that just can''t be seen.  The blue cast is a nice touch.  This is a good picture, but at this size, which I''m sure is the legal maximum, it seems that the really interesting detailed parts are just too small.  Maybe it''d be possible to just concentrate on the bottom guys in the monument.  It looks like a pretty cool tribute to the fighting men of wwII</td>', 'This photo needs to be so much bigger.  There is a ton of details that just can''t be seen.  The blue cast is a nice touch.  This is a good picture, but at this size, which I''m sure is the legal maximum, it seems that the really interesting detailed parts are just too small.  Maybe it''d be possible to just concentrate on the bottom guys in the monument.  It looks like a pretty cool tribute to the fighting men of wwII', '2003-08-31 09:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(405164, 34716, 10978, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does that building look like it is leaning a bit...yikes!!  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is it just me or does that building look like it is leaning a bit...yikes!!  Nice shot.', '2003-08-31 13:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(405207, 34654, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of the lighting, but wish it was at a different time of day so it lit the face. Or maybe this was intentional?</td>', 'I like the quality of the lighting, but wish it was at a different time of day so it lit the face. Or maybe this was intentional?', '2003-08-31 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(405208, 34563, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the mail (I had to....)<br/>Kind of wish the background was either sharper or blurrier, or maybe darker. The clock face attracts too much attention. After the voting it should be relatively easy to create a mask to try it out.</td>', 'Nice detail on the mail (I had to....)Kind of wish the background was either sharper or blurrier, or maybe darker. The clock face attracts too much attention. After the voting it should be relatively easy to create a mask to try it out.', '2003-08-31 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(405211, 34900, 1031, '<td valign="top">I would have been SO tempted to make it a purple duotone to take advantage of the perfect clouds for this subject!</td>', 'I would have been SO tempted to make it a purple duotone to take advantage of the perfect clouds for this subject!', '2003-08-31 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(405212, 34507, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have tried to keep the sword tip, at the expense of some of the pedestal if necessary.</td>', 'I think I''d have tried to keep the sword tip, at the expense of some of the pedestal if necessary.', '2003-08-31 14:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405213, 34557, 1031, '<td valign="top">That must be quite impressive in person. It''s interesting that, as photographed, it''s really impossible to tell if this is a 50-foot tall statue or a tabletop piece!  I''m not sure if that ambiguity is useful in the context if this challenge.</td>', 'That must be quite impressive in person. It''s interesting that, as photographed, it''s really impossible to tell if this is a 50-foot tall statue or a tabletop piece!  I''m not sure if that ambiguity is useful in the context if this challenge.', '2003-08-31 14:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(405224, 34612, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept...</td>', 'Beautiful concept...', '2003-08-31 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(405225, 34877, 4517, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. Excellent composition, the scoreboard in the background makes this shot work. Very sharp and clean, you can even see a cobweb under the leg. Deserves a ribbon 10 +</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. Excellent composition, the scoreboard in the background makes this shot work. Very sharp and clean, you can even see a cobweb under the leg. Deserves a ribbon 10 +', '2003-08-31 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(405229, 34368, 8637, '<td valign="top">Clever!!  Very well done, nice set up.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Clever!!  Very well done, nice set up. ', '2003-08-31 15:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(405232, 34563, 8610, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus and good contrast. You will have 8 point just like the clock show</td>', 'Very sharp focus and good contrast. You will have 8 point just like the clock show', '2003-08-31 15:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(405234, 34807, 8637, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting...great work.</td>', 'Superb lighting...great work.', '2003-08-31 15:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(405240, 34221, 8643, '<td valign="top">Like the yellow lighting against the darl blue sky - very creative - 9</td>', 'Like the yellow lighting against the darl blue sky - very creative - 9', '2003-08-31 16:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(405247, 34137, 7778, '<td valign="top">The subject, certainly, is interesting. With perspective and composition nearly coinciding, a marked order of planes (lawn &gt; steps &gt; arches &gt; mural &gt; roof etc.). The hatted pair of onlookers in the left third is well used to offer a needed variation of overall symmetry.<br/> <br/>The lighting, although advantageous in part (emphasis on hats and the gables distinguishing the the ''planes''), is quite harsh and fails to reveal much of the rich and intricate detail on the facades. I could also imagine a slightly tighter crop (right, bottom to top), to exclude some redundant information (tree leaves, several rows of tiles, part of right tower). Not an easy photo to compose in a fully satisfying way, really.<br/> <br/>The inclusion of the foreground (lawn) or the given amount of it is something I''m still pondering... <br/> <br/>All in all, a worthwhile capture. If it was mine, I''d consider re-shooting it at different times of day, if practical, under varied light.</td>', 'The subject, certainly, is interesting. With perspective and composition nearly coinciding, a marked order of planes (lawn > steps > arches > mural > roof etc.). The hatted pair of onlookers in the left third is well used to offer a needed variation of overall symmetry. The lighting, although advantageous in part (emphasis on hats and the gables distinguishing the the ''planes''), is quite harsh and fails to reveal much of the rich and intricate detail on the facades. I could also imagine a slightly tighter crop (right, bottom to top), to exclude some redundant information (tree leaves, several rows of tiles, part of right tower). Not an easy photo to compose in a fully satisfying way, really. The inclusion of the foreground (lawn) or the given amount of it is something I''m still pondering...  All in all, a worthwhile capture. If it was mine, I''d consider re-shooting it at different times of day, if practical, under varied light.', '2003-08-31 16:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(405268, 34368, 11766, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.</td>', 'Love the idea.', '2003-08-31 17:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(405277, 34887, 280, '<td valign="top">Although the sun gives the walls a nice orange tint, the shadows cast by the low sun are distracting from the overall image.</td>', 'Although the sun gives the walls a nice orange tint, the shadows cast by the low sun are distracting from the overall image.', '2003-08-31 17:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(405286, 34909, 280, '<td valign="top">The background clouds seem a little dark, shame you couldnt have taken this on a brighter day. Although you have made good use of negative space and possition of the subject is spot on IMHO.</td>', 'The background clouds seem a little dark, shame you couldnt have taken this on a brighter day. Although you have made good use of negative space and possition of the subject is spot on IMHO.', '2003-08-31 17:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(405293, 34901, 280, '<td valign="top">The column looks to be at a very slight angle and may have benefited from being rotated anticlockwise slightly?</td>', 'The column looks to be at a very slight angle and may have benefited from being rotated anticlockwise slightly?', '2003-08-31 17:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(405298, 34557, 280, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject well captured, unfortunatly the weather wasnt your friend on the day you took this shot, with that dull blue sky. Would have been tempted to increase the saturation of the blue tones using the hue/saturation option in a photo-editing package if you have one.</td>', 'Interesting subject well captured, unfortunatly the weather wasnt your friend on the day you took this shot, with that dull blue sky. Would have been tempted to increase the saturation of the blue tones using the hue/saturation option in a photo-editing package if you have one.', '2003-08-31 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(405299, 34556, 280, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but this shot is a little too bright overexposing the sky and Lincoln''s nose.</td>', 'Interesting subject but this shot is a little too bright overexposing the sky and Lincoln''s nose.', '2003-08-31 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(405302, 34507, 280, '<td valign="top">Looks over exposed to me  and I would have cropped slightly higher to avoid cropping the raised sword.</td>', 'Looks over exposed to me  and I would have cropped slightly higher to avoid cropping the raised sword.', '2003-08-31 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(405304, 34899, 280, '<td valign="top">Love the purple tint and the shadows, good job.</td>', 'Love the purple tint and the shadows, good job.', '2003-08-31 18:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(405306, 34867, 280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of an interesting building, shame the wording is so difficult to make out.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of an interesting building, shame the wording is so difficult to make out.', '2003-08-31 18:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(405308, 34792, 280, '<td valign="top">The grave dosent really stand out from the background, maybe an increase in contrast may help?</td>', 'The grave dosent really stand out from the background, maybe an increase in contrast may help?', '2003-08-31 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(405310, 34910, 280, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a nice night shot, however the floodlight seems to be overwhelming.</td>', 'Overall this is a nice night shot, however the floodlight seems to be overwhelming.', '2003-08-31 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
