(405849, 34897, 6870, '<td valign="top">I had a one track mind here. I really wanted the space to indicate, vaguely, the men and women who have died in subsequent wars to this, thus emphasizing the irony. Zeuszen''s comment, below, is indicative of why this did not succeed as I had hoped. I was even blind to the rust spot and other weirdities. Thanks for your comments, if you did.</td>', 'I had a one track mind here. I really wanted the space to indicate, vaguely, the men and women who have died in subsequent wars to this, thus emphasizing the irony. Zeuszen''s comment, below, is indicative of why this did not succeed as I had hoped. I was even blind to the rust spot and other weirdities. Thanks for your comments, if you did.', '2003-09-01 02:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
