(406153, 34318, 4493, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=41727" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">More information on what this is...</a> <br/> <br/>I wanted to capture a unique perspective on the John F. Kennedy Memorial in Dallas, Texas. To many times I see this shot straight on and it looses it''s interest to me. This is a fantastic piece of art and I wanted to convey that with my images.<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'More information on what this is...  I wanted to capture a unique perspective on the John F. Kennedy Memorial in Dallas, Texas. To many times I see this shot straight on and it looses it''s interest to me. This is a fantastic piece of art and I wanted to convey that with my images. -danny', '2003-09-01 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(406167, 34909, 5475, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by magnetic9999:</b></div><hr/><i>this was one of my top shots.  great composition and imagination!</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Kollin,<br/>I was trying to get it dark enough for the clouds to appear like smoke from a fire, yet still have some blues and whites.  It was a tough balancing act, and I got quite a few comments about it being dark and lack of details on the sculpture.  I intend to go back and shoot this some more, I just don''t know if I will get a great sky like this again!<br/>Thanks for the vote of confidence!<br/>JD</td>', 'Originally posted by magnetic9999:this was one of my top shots.  great composition and imagination! Thanks Kollin,I was trying to get it dark enough for the clouds to appear like smoke from a fire, yet still have some blues and whites.  It was a tough balancing act, and I got quite a few comments about it being dark and lack of details on the sculpture.  I intend to go back and shoot this some more, I just don''t know if I will get a great sky like this again!Thanks for the vote of confidence!JD', '2003-09-01 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
