(406509, 34115, 7778, '<td valign="top">Beautifully balanced light/dark composition. The deliberately (?) overexposed sky adds a flat dimension to an otherwise spatial image, encouraging attention to texture and its corresponding patterns. The tension between these two elements makes for a dynamic photo rich with the kind of utilitarian/industrial detail not only a minimalist will enjoy. Remarkable, IMO, is the distribution of available light in this capture.<br/> <br/>Certainly NOT an avarage shot.<br/> <br/><b>Zeus'' Top Pic(k)s: 3rd Place</b></td>', 'Beautifully balanced light/dark composition. The deliberately (?) overexposed sky adds a flat dimension to an otherwise spatial image, encouraging attention to texture and its corresponding patterns. The tension between these two elements makes for a dynamic photo rich with the kind of utilitarian/industrial detail not only a minimalist will enjoy. Remarkable, IMO, is the distribution of available light in this capture. Certainly NOT an avarage shot. Zeus'' Top Pic(k)s: 3rd Place', '2003-09-01 17:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
